        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "7100db3f-9606-5c97-b39b-ca78eb96789c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Craig Gillespie, Thomas McCarthy, Steve \"Spaz\" Williams, Ed Decter, John J. Strauss, Mark Gibson, Philip Halprin, Lake Bell\n- Companies: Walt Disney Pictures\n- Films: Million Dollar Arm, The Wild, Over Her Dead Body, What Happens in Vegas, It's Complicated, No Strings Attached, The Secret Life of Pets\n- Television Series: Boston Legal, Surface, How to Make It in America, Childrens Hospital\n\nFacts:\n- The television series Boston Legal starred Lake Bell from 2004 to 2006.\n- The television series Surface starred Lake Bell from 2005 to 2006.\n- The film The Wild is a 2006 American 3D computer-animated comedy directed by Steve \"Spaz\" Williams and written by Ed Decter, John J. Strauss, Mark Gibson, and Philip Halprin.\n- The television series Childrens Hospital starred Lake Bell from 2008 to 2016.\n- Lake Bell appeared in the films Over Her Dead Body and What Happens in Vegas in 2008.\n- Lake Bell appeared in the film It's Complicated in 2009.\n- The television series How to Make It in America starred Lake Bell from 2010 to 2011.\n- Lake Bell appeared in the film No Strings Attached in 2011.\n- The film Million Dollar Arm is a 2014 American biographical sports drama directed by Craig Gillespie, produced by Walt Disney Pictures, and written by Thomas McCarthy.\n- Lake Bell appeared in the film Million Dollar Arm in 2014.\n- Lake Bell appeared in the film The Secret Life of Pets in 2016.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
